{"t":"PPG","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"PPG Industries, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","employees":43500,"hq":"Pittsburgh, PA, United States","website":"https://www.ppg.com","summary_en":"PPG Industries, Inc. manufactures and distributes paints, coatings, and specialty materials in the United States, Canada, the Asia Pacific, Latin America, Europe, the Middle East, and Africa. It operates through three segments: Global Architectural Coatings, Performance Coatings, and Industrial Coatings. The Global Architectural Coatings segment supplies a variety of decorative coatings, adhesives, sealants, and finishes, as well as paint strippers, stains, and related chemicals. Its Performance Coatings segment offers aerospace coatings, automotive refinishing coatings, protective and marine coatings, and traffic solutions comprising paints, thermoplastics, raised pavement markers, and other technologies for pavement marking. The Industrial Coatings segment provides automotive OEM coatings, industrial coatings, and packaging coatings, as well as specialty products, such as optical monomers and coatings, low-friction coatings, and other specialty products. The company delivers its products to company-owned stores, home centers and other consumer retail outlets, paint dealers, concessionaires and independent distributors, company-owned distribution networks, and directly to manufacturing companies and retail customers. PPG Industries, Inc. was incorporated in 1883 and is headquartered in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"PPG Industries, Inc.는 미국, 캐나다, 아시아 태평양, 라틴 아메리카, 유럽, 중동 및 아프리카에서 페인트, 코팅 및 특수 재료를 제조 및 유통합니다. 글로벌 건축 코팅, 성능 코팅 및 산업용 코팅의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 글로벌 건축 코팅 부문은 다양한 장식 코팅, 접착제, 실런트 및 마감재는 물론 페인트 제거제, 얼룩 및 관련 화학 물질을 공급합니다. Performance Coatings 부문에서는 항공우주 코팅, 자동차 재도장 코팅, 보호 및 해양 코팅, 페인트, 열가소성 수지, 돌출된 도로 표지 및 기타 도로 표시용 기술로 구성된 교통 솔루션을 제공합니다. 산업용 코팅 부문은 자동차 OEM 코팅, 산업용 코팅, 포장 코팅뿐만 아니라 광학 모노머 및 코팅, 저마찰 코팅, 기타 특수 제품과 같은 특수 제품도 제공합니다. 회사는 회사 소유 매장, 홈 센터 및 기타 소비자 소매점, 페인트 딜러, 영업권자 및 독립 유통업체, 회사 소유 유통 네트워크에 제품을 제공하고 제조 회사 및 소매 고객에게 직접 제품을 제공합니다. PPG Industries, Inc.는 1883년에 설립되었으며 펜실베이니아주 피츠버그에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":123.27,"mcap":27230343168.0,"pe":17.313202,"fpe":14.244708,"peg":1.741,"ps":1.631341,"pb":3.2088192,"ev_ebitda":12.04,"div":2.4,"beta":0.987,"hi52":133.43,"lo52":93.39},"fin":{"rev":16691999744.0,"rev_g":0.066,"eps_g":0.011,"gross":0.41181,"op":0.14657,"net":0.094060004,"roe":0.19487,"fcf":1097374976.0,"cash":1642000000.0,"debt":7473999872.0,"de":86.615,"eps":7.12,"feps":8.65374},"own":{"short":0.0348,"inst":0.9423,"insider":0.0010899999},"analyst":{"n":22,"mean":130.13635,"median":130.5,"high":140.0,"low":115.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.12,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":10,"hold":13,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":10,"hold":12,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":9,"hold":13,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":130.0,"priorPriceTarget":125.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","FromGrade":"Sector Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":123.0,"priorPriceTarget":115.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":130.0,"priorPriceTarget":118.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":123.0,"priorPriceTarget":116.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":137.0,"priorPriceTarget":136.0},{"GradeDate":